{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同學！」「給我過來瓜生！」", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔／紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 502, "voice": "go052", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早安……安潔，今天沒有站在校門啊。」", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那種事情現在無所謂了！」", "text_idx": 476, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0466", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，你跟愛理什麼都沒有是真的嗎！？」", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0176", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "視線越過兩人的肩膀望向教室內。", "text_idx": 548, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……愛理滿臉通紅地低著頭。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理同學堅持說上星期的新吾同學只是身體不舒服而已。」", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0467", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是旁人看起來明明就是有問題，說什麼事都沒有根本在騙人！」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0177", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也就是說，先到學校的愛理，在我出現前的這段時間已經被質問一番了……", "text_idx": 489, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然她應該很努力轉移話題，但現在一臉因為疲憊和羞恥而快死掉的表情。", "text_idx": 551, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安潔以為兩位一定是在心意相通的過程中。」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0468", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是愛理對你好像已經變成稱呼名字了。」", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0178", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾同學，真的跟愛理同學什麼事都沒發生嗎！？」", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0469", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我偷瞄了愛理一眼。", "text_idx": 518, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說是！我還沒做好心理準備」。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理的眼神在對我這麼說。", "text_idx": 512, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……瞭解瞭解。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，當然啦。」", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我再自然不過地回答。", "text_idx": 519, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "幸好，這種控制表情的技巧我比愛理擅長許多。", "text_idx": 503, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "應該說正因為愛理那個模樣，我的態度必須更堅定才行。", "text_idx": 515, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒錯沒錯沒錯！」愛理在遠處連連點頭。", "text_idx": 459, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好，就照這樣……", "text_idx": 500, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我跟愛理是朋友。」", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「朋友……！！！」", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1978", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……此時，愛理突然僵住了。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0179", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「朋友……」", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1979", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虛軟……", "text_idx": 547, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛、愛理同學？」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0470", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我去洗手間……」", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1980", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "全員", "alt_speaker_idx": 492, "voice": "go053", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她垂下肩膀，腳步虛浮地走掉了。", "text_idx": 497, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "該不會……被我說的「朋友」打擊到了？", "text_idx": 549, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「各位同學，早安啊……」", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 546, "voice": "mc0127", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「今天也麻煩各位了。好……咦？瀨、瀨名同學呢？」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 546, "voice": "mc0128", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理直到班會開始都沒有回來。", "text_idx": 513, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "明、明明是她自己說要保密的……！", "text_idx": 530, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說、說的也是，抱歉，你說的沒錯！」", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1981", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "第１節課後的下課時間。", "text_idx": 538, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "班會結束後愛理就回來了。而現在我把她拉到教室角落確認現狀。", "text_idx": 536, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「再、再嘗試一次。」", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1982", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……老實說出來比較好吧？」", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不行！太羞恥了！」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1983", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理大步地走向安潔她們。", "text_idx": 509, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好吧，愛理都這樣說了，我就配合她……", "text_idx": 499, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，小愛理他們回來了。」", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 541, "voice": "mu0266", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們在教室角落討論的時候，隼太也來到學校了，天羽學姊跟櫻乃也來了。", "text_idx": 517, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「上星期，因為你們兩人相處得很不好，我有點在意──」", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 541, "voice": "mu0267", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「大家聽我說！」", "text_idx": 8, "plain": "「大家聽我說！」", "plain_idx": 429, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1984", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理切換成宣告模式。", "text_idx": 507, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都安靜下來看著她。", "text_idx": 496, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……應該說，整個班級的人都在注視她。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要、要說什麼事都沒有的後續是嗎？」", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0472", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒錯！」", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1985", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「聽好了，我跟新吾，什麼事都沒發生。」", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1986", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "sk0556", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "唯一知道我們實際狀況的櫻乃瞄了我一眼。", "text_idx": 494, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我只能苦笑回應。", "text_idx": 521, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「很像在說謊欸～」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0181", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「變得直呼名字了呢。但是，並不是關係更進一步嗎？」", "text_idx": 473, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 541, "voice": "mu0268", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「或者說固定下來的關係……」", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0473", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當、當然了！」", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1987", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然臉紅得很明顯，但仍拼命堅持的愛理。", "text_idx": 552, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來她是真的非常不想讓大家知道。", "text_idx": 537, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……不過。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾他，只是……」", "text_idx": 450, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1988", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是……」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1989", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1990", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只、只是？」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0474", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「只是……朋、朋友……」", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1991", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1992", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "才說完，她的眼眶就蓄滿了淚水……", "text_idx": 525, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨蛋！說不出口啦！因為喜歡新吾喜歡到沒有辦法了啊……！！」", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1993", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "結果，毫無掩飾地在大家面前公開了──", "text_idx": 540, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是這樣，星期五開始我們就交往了。」", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「開始交往了……」", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1994", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "午休時，固定成員們聚在一起，我向他們報告了我們的事情。", "text_idx": 493, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的～為什麼不立刻說出來呢愛理同學～」", "text_idx": 464, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0476", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉……」", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1995", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為太羞恥了……！」", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1996", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟男人交往的膚淺的自己嗎？」", "text_idx": 474, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0183", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是的。一旦注意到自己的心意後，我就喜歡新吾喜歡到無法克制……」", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1997", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我已經不同了，跟以前不同了。我不知道在大家面前該擺出什麼態度才好。」", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1998", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉，真的很抱歉。但是我非常……唔唔唔唔～！」", "text_idx": 449, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar1999", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一邊道歉，愛理一邊因為羞恥而整個人縮了起來。", "text_idx": 484, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是戀愛中的少女……！」", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0184", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊……那個愛理同學變得如此可愛……！」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0477", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真的……好想要緊緊抱住她喔……」", "text_idx": 465, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 541, "voice": "mu0270", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然我已經知道了。」", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "sk0558", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "感覺女生們因為愛理的模樣而興奮不已。", "text_idx": 514, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……♪」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 550, "voice": "ht0221", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而唯一的男生夥伴則是連連點頭微笑，手臂搭上我的肩膀。", "text_idx": 543, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯……我說，那個啊……」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 550, "voice": "ht0222", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「該怎麼樣就怎麼樣的感覺。」", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 550, "voice": "ht0223", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太……」", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喔，婚禮的演講就交給我吧。」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 550, "voice": "ht0224", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「想太遠了吧！」", "text_idx": 435, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什、別、別這樣別這樣椋梨君……！」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2000", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，你們沒有那個打算？」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 550, "voice": "ht0225", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那種重要的事情，要兩個人仔細思考……」", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2001", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀啊啊愛理同學有那個打算～♪」", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0478", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊啊夠了不要再調侃我了啦安潔──」", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2002", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然晚了點，不過恭喜你們。真的是太好了。」", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0479", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2003", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，真的太好了。小愛理跟瓜生君。」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 541, "voice": "mu0271", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，我一直都覺得你們很相配喔。」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 541, "voice": "mu0272", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理居然跟男人交往了啊……」", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0185", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唉，好吧，雖然不能理解，但既然發生了就要幸福喔！」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0186", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈，總之祝你們幸福啦！」", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 550, "voice": "ht0226", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 533, "voice": "sk0559", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……唔……」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2004", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "收到大家的祝福──", "text_idx": 527, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%51;「謝謝……」", "text_idx": 9, "plain": "「謝謝……」", "plain_idx": 472, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2005", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呀啊呀啊，愛理同學又更害羞了♪」", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0480", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理把自己縮得更小了。", "text_idx": 511, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生！要是敢對愛理不好我就殺了你喔！」", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 539, "voice": "sn0187", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「正是如此！之後就麻煩你了，就算為了自己的性命著想！」", "text_idx": 457, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 501, "voice": "ag0481", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而我則受到生命威脅了。", "text_idx": 544, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好羞恥、好羞恥！在做好心理準備前就被大家……」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2006", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒事沒事，這也是沒辦法的。」", "text_idx": 458, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔唔……早知道會這樣，一開始就老實說出來還比較好……！」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2007", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，我也是這麼想。」", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔唔唔～～！」", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2008", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放學後。", "text_idx": 528, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理回到家後也還是害羞個不停。", "text_idx": 508, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她抱住我的手臂，紅透的臉頰壓在上面蹭來蹭去。", "text_idx": 498, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，大家都很可愛呢。」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以才更覺得羞恥了啊……！至今為止沒有被朋友說過那種話嘛。」", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2009", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像他們早就想說了……」", "text_idx": 430, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家的祝福讓我有這種感覺。", "text_idx": 495, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "他們似乎早就想看到，總是把自己繃得緊緊的愛理鬆懈下來的樣子。", "text_idx": 490, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……新吾也是？」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2010", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我是不是，愛理也知道吧？」", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2011", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是但是，那是因為是新吾啊。跟大家完全不同……」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2012", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是先開啟這個話題的人是愛理啊……", "text_idx": 491, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，這個愛哭撒嬌鬼愛理不管誰來看都會覺得可愛吧。", "text_idx": 488, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……談戀愛，好辛苦呢。」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2014", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理小聲地說，臉頰還貼在我的手臂上。", "text_idx": 510, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不是只有交往的兩個人自己的事呢……」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2015", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……的確呢。」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且在我們交往前，也受到大家很多照顧。", "text_idx": 542, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過，現在卻覺得「這樣也沒關係」……戀愛很辛苦，而且不可思議。", "text_idx": 487, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理。」", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我低下頭，溫柔地喊她。", "text_idx": 516, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2016", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我喜歡妳。」", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯咕……」", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2017", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "抱緊……", "text_idx": 526, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理使力抱住我的手臂。", "text_idx": 506, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「還、還要。」", "text_idx": 475, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2018", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 154, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喜歡愛理。」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 155, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2019", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 156, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我喜歡愛理喔。」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 529, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 157, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我反復說著。", "text_idx": 520, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 158, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯、嗯……」", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2020", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 159, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理也不停點頭，然後越來越用力抱住我的手臂。", "text_idx": 505, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 160, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "與最喜歡的人相處的時光。", "text_idx": 545, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 161, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "會讓人身體無法克制地發熱……", "text_idx": 531, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 162, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也……是喔。只有你……」", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 504, "voice": "ar2021", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 163, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想擁抱、親吻這個微笑。", "text_idx": 522, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 164, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過忍耐已經不像以前一樣辛苦了，只有對未知的行為的驚慌，以及莫名的甜蜜搔癢。", "text_idx": 486, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 165, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以現在只是讓她抱著手臂。", "text_idx": 524, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 166, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我知道只要慢慢地爬上階梯，總有一天會跟這女孩……", "text_idx": 523, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_21.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 167, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──結果這之後，直到冷靜下來為止，愛理都沒有放開我。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
